<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>About Us – Elanora Luxury Jewelry</title>
  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400&family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *,
    *::before,
    *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    :root {
      --cream: #f9f5ef;
      --warm-white: #fdfaf5;
      --gold: #c8972a;
      --gold-light: #e4b84a;
      --gold-pale: #f0ddb0;
      --dark: #1a1612;
      --text: #3a3228;
      --muted: #8c7f70;
      --border: #e8ddd0;
      --radius: 12px;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
      background: var(--warm-white);
      color: var(--text);
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* HERO */
    .page-hero {
      background: var(--cream);
      padding: 100px 60px 80px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 60px;
      align-items: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    .page-hero::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      right: 0;
      top: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8d8c0 0%, #d4c0a0 100%);
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .page-hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      animation: fadeUp .8s ease both;
    }

    .page-hero-breadcrumb {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .page-hero-breadcrumb span {
      color: var(--gold);
    }

    .page-hero-breadcrumb svg {
      width: 12px;
      height: 12px;
      stroke: var(--muted);
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 2;
    }

    .page-hero h1 {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 62px);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.15;
      color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .page-hero h1 span {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .page-hero p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.9;
      max-width: 420px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 12px 26px;
      background: var(--gold);
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background .2s;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: #a87820;
    }

    .btn-outline {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 11px 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--gold);
      background: transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all .2s;
    }

    .btn-outline:hover {
      background: var(--gold);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .page-hero-image {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      animation: fadeUp .8s .2s ease both;
    }

    .page-hero-image img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 460px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    }

    .hero-float-card {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -20px;
      left: -30px;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      animation: floatBadge 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes floatBadge {

      0%,
      100% {
        transform: translateY(0);
      }

      50% {
        transform: translateY(-6px);
      }
    }

    .hero-float-icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--gold-pale);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .hero-float-icon svg {
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      stroke: var(--gold);
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 1.5;
    }

    .hero-float-text strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--dark);
    }

    .hero-float-text span {
      font-size: 11.5px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    /* STATS */
    .stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      background: var(--dark);
    }

    .stat-item {
      padding: 44px 30px;
      text-align: center;
      border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .stat-item:last-child {
      border-right: none;
    }

    .stat-number {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 44px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--gold);
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .stat-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
      letter-spacing: .04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* STORY */
    .story {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 80px;
      padding: 100px 60px;
      background: var(--warm-white);
    }

    .story-content h2 {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 48px);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      color: var(--dark);
    }

    .story-content h2 em {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-style: normal;
      background: var(--gold-pale);
      padding: 0 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .story-content p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.9;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .story-image {
      position: relative;
    }

    .story-image img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 520px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      display: block;
    }

    .story-accent {
      position: absolute;
      top: -20px;
      right: -20px;
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--gold-pale);
      border: 4px solid var(--warm-white);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--gold);
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 1.5;
      padding: 12px;
    }

    /* MISSION VISION */
    .mission-vision {
      padding: 80px 60px;
      background: var(--cream);
    }

    .section-label {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: .1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      background: var(--gold-pale);
      border-radius: 20px;
    }

    .mv-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
      margin-top: 50px;
    }

    .mv-card {
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 44px 40px;
      transition: box-shadow .3s;
    }

    .mv-card:hover {
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    .mv-card-icon {
      width: 52px;
      height: 52px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: var(--gold-pale);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .mv-card-icon svg {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      stroke: var(--gold);
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 1.5;
    }

    .mv-card h3 {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .mv-card p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    /* VALUES */
    .values {
      padding: 80px 60px;
      background: var(--warm-white);
    }

    .section-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
    }

    .section-header h2 {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 44px);
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .section-header p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 480px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .values-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .value-card {
      padding: 36px 30px;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--cream);
      text-align: center;
      transition: transform .3s, box-shadow .3s;
    }

    .value-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    .value-icon {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: var(--gold-pale);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
    }

    .value-icon svg {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      stroke: var(--gold);
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 1.5;
    }

    .value-card h3 {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .value-card p {
      font-size: 12.5px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    /* TEAM */
    .team {
      padding: 80px 60px;
      background: var(--cream);
    }

    .team-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 28px;
      margin-top: 50px;
    }

    .team-card {
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: #fff;
      transition: transform .3s, box-shadow .3s;
    }

    .team-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    .team-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 300px;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
      transition: transform .4s;
    }

    .team-card:hover img {
      transform: scale(1.04);
    }

    .team-info {
      padding: 22px 24px;
    }

    .team-info h3 {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--dark);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .team-info span {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--gold);
    }

    .team-info p {
      font-size: 12.5px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    /* CTA */
    .cta {
      margin: 0 60px 80px;
      background: var(--dark);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 80px 60px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .cta-content h2 {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 44px);
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .cta-content h2 span {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .cta-content p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
      line-height: 1.8;
      max-width: 420px;
    }

    .cta-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .btn-gold {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 13px 28px;
      background: var(--gold);
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background .2s;
    }

    .btn-gold:hover {
      background: #a87820;
    }

    .btn-ghost {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 13px 28px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      background: transparent;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all .2s;
    }

    .btn-ghost:hover {
      border-color: var(--gold);
      color: var(--gold);
    }

    /* ANIMATIONS */
    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(30px);
      }

      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    /* IMG PLACEHOLDER */
    .img-placeholder {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8d8c0 0%, #d4c0a0 100%);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .img-placeholder span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      opacity: .6;
    }

    /* RESPONSIVE */
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .page-hero {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        padding: 80px 40px 60px;
      }

      .page-hero::after {
        display: none;
      }

      .page-hero-image img {
        height: 360px;
      }

      .stats {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      .stat-item {
        border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      }

      .stat-item:nth-child(2n) {
        border-right: none;
      }

      .story {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 40px;
        padding: 80px 40px;
      }

      .mission-vision {
        padding: 60px 40px;
      }

      .mv-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .values {
        padding: 60px 40px;
      }

      .values-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      .team {
        padding: 60px 40px;
      }

      .team-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      .cta {
        margin: 0 40px 60px;
        padding: 60px 40px;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .page-hero {
        padding: 60px 30px 50px;
      }

      .story {
        padding: 60px 30px;
      }

      .mission-vision,
      .values,
      .team {
        padding: 50px 30px;
      }

      .values-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .team-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .cta {
        margin: 0 30px 50px;
        padding: 50px 30px;
      }

      .cta-actions {
        flex-direction: column;
        width: 100%;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .page-hero {
        padding: 50px 20px 40px;
      }

      .story {
        padding: 50px 20px;
      }

      .mission-vision,
      .values,
      .team {
        padding: 40px 20px;
      }

      .cta {
        margin: 0 20px 40px;
        padding: 40px 20px;
      }

      .stats {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <nav>
    <%- include('partials/user/header') %>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-content">
      <div class="page-hero-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;">Home</a>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M9 18l6-6-6-6" />
        </svg>
        <span>About Us</span>
      </div>
      <h1>Crafting <span>Timeless</span><br>Beauty Since 2015</h1>
      <p>Born from a passion for extraordinary craftsmanship, Elanora is a celebration of fine jewellery that speaks to
        the soul. Every piece tells a story of artistry, heritage, and refined elegance.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="/shop" class="btn-primary">
          Explore Collection
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-outline">Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="page-hero-image">
      <img src="images/home/Submain pic 1.jpeg" alt="Elanora jewelry model"
        onerror="this.parentElement.innerHTML='<div class=img-placeholder style=height:460px><span>About Hero</span></div>'" />
      <div class="hero-float-card">
        <div class="hero-float-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-float-text">
          <strong>Certified Authentic</strong>
          <span>Hallmark Guaranteed</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STATS -->
  <div class="stats">
    <div class="stat-item">
      <div class="stat-number">10+</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Years of Craftsmanship</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <div class="stat-number">230K</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Happy Clients</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <div class="stat-number">500+</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Unique Designs</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <div class="stat-number">18</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Countries Served</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- STORY -->
  <section class="story">
    <div class="story-image">
      <img src="images/home/Submain pic 2.jpeg" alt="Our story"
        onerror="this.parentElement.innerHTML='<div class=img-placeholder style=height:520px;border-radius:12px><span>Story Image</span></div>'" />
      <div class="story-accent">Est.<br>2015<br>India</div>
    </div>
    <div class="story-content">
      <span class="section-label">Our Story</span>
      <h2>A Legacy of<br><em>Artistry</em> & Passion</h2>
      <p>Elanora was founded in 2015 with a singular vision — to bring the world's finest jewellery to those who
        appreciate beauty in its purest form. What began as a small atelier in the heart of India has grown into a
        beloved brand trusted by over 230,000 clients worldwide.</p>
      <p>Every piece in our collection is meticulously handcrafted by master artisans who have spent decades perfecting
        their craft. We source only the most responsibly obtained precious metals and gemstones, ensuring that your
        jewellery is as ethical as it is beautiful.</p>
      <p>From the first sketch to the final polish, we obsess over every detail — because we believe that true luxury
        lies in the things you cannot see.</p>
      <a href="/shop" class="btn-outline" style="margin-top:8px;">Discover Our Collections</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MISSION & VISION -->
  <section class="mission-vision">
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:10px;">
      <span class="section-label">What Drives Us</span>
      <h2
        style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,44px);font-weight:400;color:var(--dark);margin-top:10px;">
        Our Mission &amp; Vision</h2>
      <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);max-width:480px;margin:12px auto 0;line-height:1.8;">Two pillars that
        guide every creation, every interaction, and every decision we make.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mv-grid">
      <div class="mv-card">
        <div class="mv-card-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" />
            <path
              d="M12 1v4M12 19v4M4.22 4.22l2.83 2.83M16.95 16.95l2.83 2.83M1 12h4M19 12h4M4.22 19.78l2.83-2.83M16.95 7.05l2.83-2.83" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Our Mission</h3>
        <p>To craft jewellery of uncompromising quality that transcends trends — pieces that become heirlooms, passed
          down through generations as symbols of love, milestones, and unforgettable memories. We are committed to
          making fine jewellery accessible without sacrificing an ounce of artistry.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mv-card">
        <div class="mv-card-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z" />
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Our Vision</h3>
        <p>To be the most trusted and beloved fine jewellery brand in the world — a name synonymous with radiant
          elegance, ethical sourcing, and extraordinary craftsmanship. We envision a world where every woman wears
          jewellery that tells her unique story.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- VALUES -->
  <section class="values">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-label">Why Choose Elanora</span>
      <h2>The Elanora Difference</h2>
      <p>Six pillars that set us apart and define the Elanora promise to every client we serve.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="values-grid">
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Certified Authenticity</h3>
        <p>Every piece comes with a hallmark certificate ensuring genuine precious metals and conflict-free gemstones.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="value-icon">
